      "blurb": "Earth Release: Stone Dragon",
      "summonRole": "Stone Dragon",
      "biography": "<p><em>Earth Release: Stone Dragon (A-Rank, concentration up to 1 minute).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC; you command it as a Bonus Action.</p><p><strong>Large Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 13 + your Ninjutsu ability modifier, DR 8 · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 80 + 20 for every rank above A-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft. fly.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +5 (save +9), DEX +0 (save +4), CON +8 (save +12), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Cold, Poison, Psychic, Bludgeoning, Piercing, Slashing. <strong>Damage Vulnerabilities</strong> Lightning. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC from your Ninjutsu modifier, hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
